Traps
-----

* Route order in challengeRoutes.ts. GET /:challengeId is registered last on
  purpose. Adding a new static path below it makes that path unreachable.

* The faculty display string is an interface. serializers.ts maps the nine
  Faculty enum values to faculty1..faculty9 and both clients key their art and
  colours off the result. Editing a faculty name without editing the map sends
  every affected user to the faculty9 fallback.

* Level maths exists in two places, meController.levelFromXp and
  serializers.levelFromXp. They currently agree. Change both or neither.

* Season classification also exists twice, in utils/season.ts and in the admin
  frontend. Same rule.

* Socket events must be emitted after the transaction commits. Emitting inside
  a transaction that later rolls back tells the clients about a change that
  did not happen.


